<title>UK: Birkby gets regulatory OK for acquisition.</title>
<headline>Birkby gets regulatory OK for acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Space management company Birkby Plc said on Monday it had received the necessary regulatory approval for its proposed acquisition of British Coal Enterprises. The company, a provider of managed work and retail space, said it expected to seek shareholder approval of the deal in the near future.</p>
<p>Birkby said earlier this month that the transaction would nearly double its number of workspace centres.</p>
<p>The company's statement did not disclose terms of the deal.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
